            "title": "Kering shareholders approve appointment of Luca de Meo as CEO",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "PARIS (Reuters) -Shareholders for Gucci owner Kering approved the appointment of Luca de Meo as the group's CEO at its extraordinary shareholder meeting on Tuesday.  At the meeting's vote, 98.97% of the shareholders backed de Meo's appointment.  De Meo, who was hired from French automaker Renault in June, is taking over the job from Francois-Henri Pinault, who will remain the company's chairman.",
